\label{sec:conclusion}

Output-distribution alignment is the primary design dimension, outperforming BCE/MSE across five losses and three architectures (7--14B) with 14.5\% PPL reduction at 30\%; gains are task-type dependent (commonsense up, knowledge down; C4 control confirms structural to KL), suggesting KL for commonsense/PPL, TEAL for knowledge tasks.
